{"ref":"powerup:preserve","lead":[{"k":"figure","i":"Sprite-Preserve.png","w":128,"h":128,"c":[]},{"k":"p","c":["Preserve is one of the player stats in Vampire Survivors. It provides a chance to retain uses of ",{"i":"Sprite-Reroll.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:reroll"}," ",{"t":"Reroll","r":"powerup:reroll"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Skip.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:skip"}," ",{"t":"Skip","r":"powerup:skip"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Banish.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:banish"}," ",{"t":"Banish","r":"powerup:banish"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"PowerUp","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["28 October 2025 (Update)"]]},{"label":"ID","cells":[["RECYCLE"]]},{"label":"Max level","cells":[["5"]]},{"label":"Bonus per level","cells":[["+10%"]]},{"label":"Stacking","cells":[["Additive"]]},{"label":"Max effect","cells":[["+50%"]]},{"label":"Initial cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 500"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"effects","title":"Effects","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Preserve has a chance to keep a Reroll, Skip, and Banish action after being used, allowing more uses of them in a run overall."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"powerup","title":"PowerUp","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["The Preserve PowerUp increases the chance of preserving Reroll, Skip, and Banish by 10% per rank, with a maximum rank of 5. At rank 5, there is a 50% chance to preserve them. It initially costs ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 500, and is unlocked by collecting ",{"i":"Sprite-Wax_Fetish.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:wax-fetish"}," ",{"t":"Wax Fetish","r":"relic:wax-fetish"}," in ",{"t":"Mazerella","r":"stage:mazerella"},"."]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Level"],"h":1},{"c":["Preserve"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["1"]},{"c":["10%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["2"]},{"c":["20%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["3"]},{"c":["30%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["4"]},{"c":["40%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["5"]},{"c":["50%"]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Similar to ",{"i":"Sprite-Cooldown.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:cooldown"}," ",{"t":"Cooldown","r":"powerup:cooldown"},", while the effect of each rank is additive, the result is exponential as the chance of a recycled action getting recycled again increases with each rank. If getting Preserve to 100% were possible, it would grant infinite uses of ",{"i":"Sprite-Reroll.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:reroll"}," ",{"t":"Reroll","r":"powerup:reroll"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Skip.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:skip"}," ",{"t":"Skip","r":"powerup:skip"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Banish.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:banish"}," ",{"t":"Banish","r":"powerup:banish"}," as long as there is one to start with."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 28 October 2025 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]},{"c":["Name changed back to Preserve."]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["beta ",{"i":"Steam_logo.svg","w":16,"h":16,"a":"Steam"}," 1 October 2025 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Name changed from Preserve to Recycle."]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["beta ",{"i":"Steam_logo.svg","w":16,"h":16,"a":"Steam"}," 4 August 2025 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Released in beta version."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Preserve, ",{"i":"Sprite-Charm.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:charm"}," ",{"t":"Charm","r":"powerup:charm"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Fever.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:fever"}," ",{"t":"Fever","r":"powerup:fever"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Defang.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:defang"}," ",{"t":"Defang","r":"powerup:defang"},", Invulnerability Time, and Thorns are the only character stats in the game that are not displayed on the stat panel."]}]}],"subs":[]}]}